---
description: Keep the Semantic Personal File Navigator in-scope
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is a personal file navigator. Agents must:

- Only add features that help users find documents they uploaded.
- Never add web browsing, shell execution, mass file delete, or a general chatbot.
- Keep guardrails in `semantic_navigator/guardrails.py` as the single scope lock.
- Refuse to index arbitrary filesystem paths from the server.
- Update PROJECT.md when behaviour changes.
